# Security headers served by Cloudflare Workers Static Assets.
# Lighthouse Best Practices scoring: HSTS + COOP + X-Frame-Options +
# X-Content-Type-Options + Referrer-Policy + Permissions-Policy is the
# set that lifts the score from 96 → 100 on incognito audits.
#
# Content-Security-Policy is NO LONGER set here. It moved to an
# Astro-generated per-page `<meta http-equiv>` CSP (see astro.config.mjs
# `security.csp`), which emits SHA-256 hashes for every inline
# `<script>`/`<style>` Astro renders — including the Hero neural canvas,
# copy buttons, and waitlist submit — so `'unsafe-inline'` is gone and
# the XSS amplifier the old header CSP carried is closed. External hosts
# (Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon + Turnstile, Google Fonts) and the
# non-script/style directives (default-src, connect-src incl. the
# explicit https://onebrain.run RUM token, img-src 'self' data:,
# frame-src challenges.cloudflare.com, etc.) are configured there.
#
# `frame-ancestors` is enforced via `X-Frame-Options: DENY` below, NOT
# CSP: browsers ignore `frame-ancestors` in a <meta> CSP, so the header
# is the clickjacking control of record.
#
# HSTS `preload` (added 2026-05-19) is a one-way commitment: once
# submitted to hstspreload.org, onebrain.run + every `*.onebrain.run`
# subdomain is locked to HTTPS in browsers for ~max-age (2y). Rollback =
# drop the directive here, ship the update for max-age duration, then
# request removal at hstspreload.org/removal. Any future subdomain
# (e.g. Cloud's `app.onebrain.run`) MUST launch HTTPS-only from day 1.

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), interest-cohort=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/diagrams/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/brain.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/og.jpg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/apple-touch-icon.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
